  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building of Home Industries Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice.Beneficieries:2000.Description: Home Industries Limited (HIL) is a woman owned organization that adds value to groundnuts and rice. HIL is seeking for funding to expand their rice business especially because they have opened up new markets in USA and South Africa. They are seeking for funding to held farmers get quality seed, to improve the quality of processed rice by buying their own machine, train the farmers, improve management and systems at the company and improve on quality assurance as they are also looking at a Scotland market.</narrative>
  </description>
